// Engine shed: 44 × 18 m of soot-dark brick, 8 m to the eaves. Two tracks run in through its east end (the level lays
// the tracks; the doorways are where they come in, at z 6 and 13). A steel gantry 4.5 m up runs the length of the north
// wall, with stairs up at the west end and, alongside it, at the east end; the roof has three skylights, their glass
// long gone.
// Wall segments: 0 north (x 0→44), 1 east (z 0→18), 2 south (x 44→0, at_m = 44 − x), 3 west (z 18→0, at_m = 18 − z).
{
  "id": "engine_shed",
